  "ne23:0.4": "3. 2. 4. padaṭṭhāno hārasampāto. ",
  "ne23:1.1": "tattha katamo padaṭṭhāno hārasampāto: ",
  "ne23:2.1": "“tasmā rakkhitacitta’ssa sammāsaṅkappagocaro”ti gāthā ",
  "ne23:2.2": "“tasmā rakkhitacitta’ssā”ti tiṇṇaṃ sucaritānaṃ padaṭṭhānaṃ; ",
  "ne23:2.3": "“sammāsaṅkappagocaro”ti samathassa padaṭṭhānaṃ; ",
  "ne23:2.4": "sammādiṭṭhipurekkhāro”ti vipassanāya padaṭṭhānaṃ; ",
  "ne23:2.5": "ñatvāna udayabbaya”nti dassanabhūmiyā padaṭṭhānaṃ; ",
  "ne23:2.6": "“thīnamiddhābhibhū bhikkhū”ti viriyassa padaṭṭhānaṃ; ",
  "ne23:2.7": "“sabbāduggatiyo jahe”ti bhāvanāya padaṭṭhānaṃ. ",
  "ne23:2.8": "niyutto padaṭṭhāno hārasampāto. "
}
